# 每 15 分钟检查定时工作流；上一次未结束时不会重复启动；关机期间错过的不补做（相对日期最多补做 7 天，无跟进下次一并检查）
# Check scheduled workflows every 15 minutes; runs never overlap; missed runs are not replayed (relative dates catch up
# to 7 days, inactivity is checked on the next run)
[Unit]
Description=Yonlink-CRM scheduled workflows every 15 minutes

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*:0/15
AccuracySec=30s
Persistent=false

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
